# Prima fotografia ternaria: Fs | Fr | R.
#
# Le regole restano intere mentre il lato dei fatti viene diviso. Ogni domanda
# usa conoscenza reale gia' residente nella KB completa:
#
#   Fs <-> R   man(socrates) + mortal(X) :- man(X)
#   Fr <-> R   planet_order(mercury, 1) + planet(X) :- planet_order(X, Order)
#   Fs <-> Fr  supports_life(earth) + planet_order(earth, 3), composti da R

[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!set PARROT0_TOOLS=1
!reset

[test singular facts cross the whole rules side]
!timeout 12
> is socrates a mortal?
< Yes.

[test relational facts cross the whole rules side]
> is mercury a planet?
< Yes.

[test singular and relational facts cross internally through rules]
> is earth habitable?
< Yes.
